On Mon, Jul 20, 2026 at 11:23:16AM +0800, Jiangshan Yi wrote:
> +++ b/crypto/asymmetric_keys/pkcs7_verify.c
> @@ -93,8 +94,8 @@ static int pkcs7_digest(struct pkcs7_message *pkcs7,
>  			goto error;
